{"seq":3,"slug":"archaeology","title":"考古学","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/history/archaeology","introMarkdown":"# 考古学 简介\n\n考古学通过对物质遗存的系统发掘和分析来重建过去人类社会的面貌，是唯一能够触及无文字记载时期历史的学科。从石器时代的打制工具到古代城市的废墟，从墓葬中的随葬品到沉船中的贸易货物，每一件器物都是一份来自过去的无声证词。考古学赋予我们阅读这些证词的能力。\n\n自学者对考古学的兴趣常常始于对古老遗址和珍贵文物的好奇，但深入学习后会发现，考古学的核心价值不在于挖掘\"宝物\"，而在于通过物质证据理解人类行为和社会变迁的系统方法。一块普通的陶片在考古学家手中，可以揭示当时的制作技术、贸易网络、饮食结构甚至社会等级制度。\n\n第一章**考古学理论**介绍文化历史考古学、过程考古学和后过程考古学等主要理论范式，帮助理解考古学家如何从物质证据推断文化含义。第二章**田野考古方法**涵盖调查、发掘、地层学和器物分析等核心技术，这是将散落的物质遗存转化为可靠历史知识的操作基础。第三章**中国考古**聚焦中华大地上从旧石器时代到历史时期的重大考古发现，展示考古证据如何补充和修正了传世文献中的历史叙述。第四章**专门考古**介绍环境考古、生物考古和水下考古等前沿方向，展示考古学如何借助自然科学方法拓展研究边界。\n\n建议在学习理论和方法的同时，多阅读具体遗址的发掘报告，了解考古知识是如何从泥土和碎片中一步步建构起来的。如果有机会参观考古遗址或博物馆，带着分析的眼光去观察器物的材质、形制和空间关系，这是最直观的考古学训练。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"archaeological-theory","title":"考古学理论","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/history/archaeology/archaeological-theory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"culture-history-approach","title":"文化历史学派","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/history/archaeology/archaeological-theory/culture-history-approach"},{"seq":2,"slug":"processual-archaeology","title":"过程考古学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/history/archaeology/archaeological-theory/processual-archaeology"},{"seq":3,"slug":"post-processual-archaeology","title":"后过程考古学","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/history/archaeology/archaeological-theory/post-processual-archaeology"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"field-methods","title":"田野考古方法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/history/archaeology/field-methods","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"survey-excavation","title":"调查与发掘","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/history/archaeology/field-methods/survey-excavation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"stratigraphy-dating","title":"地层与测年","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/history/archaeology/field-methods/stratigraphy-dating"},{"seq":3,"slug":"artifact-analysis","title":"器物分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/history/archaeology/field-methods/artifact-analysis"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"chinese-archaeology","title":"中国考古","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/history/archaeology/chinese-archaeology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"prehistoric-china","title":"史前中国","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/history/archaeology/chinese-archaeology/prehistoric-china"},{"seq":2,"slug":"bronze-age-archaeology","title":"青铜时代考古","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/history/archaeology/chinese-archaeology/bronze-age-archaeology"},{"seq":3,"slug":"historical-archaeology","title":"历史时期考古","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/history/archaeology/chinese-archaeology/historical-archaeology"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"specialized-archaeology","title":"专门考古","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/history/archaeology/specialized-archaeology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"environmental-archaeology","title":"环境考古","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/history/archaeology/specialized-archaeology/environmental-archaeology"},{"seq":2,"slug":"bioarchaeology","title":"生物考古","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/history/archaeology/specialized-archaeology/bioarchaeology"},{"seq":3,"slug":"underwater-archaeology","title":"水下考古","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/history/archaeology/specialized-archaeology/underwater-archaeology"}]}]}